Final Examinations
Final exams for all grade levels will begin on June 10, 2025. Please be guided accordingly and prepare in advance. Teachers will provide review materials and schedules by next week.

Clean-Up Drive
We will be holding a Campus Clean-Up Drive on Friday, May 30, 2025, from 8:00 AM to 11:00 AM. All students are encouraged to participate as part of our commitment to maintaining a clean and green school environment.

